":"H₂S","name":"Hydrogen sulfide","nameZh":"硫化氢","category":"inorganic","shape":"bent","shapeZh":"角形","summaryZh":"臭鸡蛋气味的剧毒气体。键角仅 92.1°，远小于水，因为硫更少发生轨道杂化。","summaryEn":"A highly toxic gas smelling of rotten eggs. Its 92.1° angle is far narrower than water because sulfur hybridises much less.","molarMass":34.076,"atoms":[{"element":"S","position":[0,0,-0.4636]},{"element":"H","position":[0.9618,0,0.4636]},{"element":"H","position":[-0.9618,0,0.4636]}],"bonds":[{"a":0,"b":1,"order":1,"length":1.336},{"a":0,"b":2,"order":1,"length":1.336}],"extent":2.264},{"id":"co","formula":"CO","formulaDisplay":"CO","name":"Carbon monoxide","nameZh":"一氧化碳","category":"inorganic","shape":"linear","shapeZh":"直线形","summaryZh":"无色无味剧毒气体。与血红蛋白结合力约为氧气的 200 倍，因而导致煤气中毒。","summaryEn":"A colourless, odourless and highly toxic gas. It binds haemoglobin roughly 200 times more strongly than oxygen does.","molarMass":28.01,"atoms":[{"element":"C","position":[-0.564,0,0]},{"element":"O","position":[0.564,0,0]}],"bonds":[{"a":0,"b":1,"order":3,"length":1.128,"offset":[0,0,-1]}],"extent":2.264},{"id":"co2","formula":"CO2","formulaDisplay":"CO₂","name":"Carbon dioxide","nameZh":"二氧化碳","category":"inorganic","shape":"linear","shapeZh":"直线形","summaryZh":"直线形分子，两个 C=O 极性相互抵消，整体无极性。主要的温室气体之一。","summaryEn":"Linear, so the two polar C=O bonds cancel and the molecule as a whole is non-polar. One of the principal greenhouse gases.","molarMass":44.009,"atoms":[{"element":"C","position":[0,0,0]},{"element":"O","position":[-1.163,0,0]},{"element":"O","position":[1.163,0,0]}],"bonds":[{"a":0,"b":1,"order":2,"length":1.163,"offset":[0,0,1]},{"a":0,"b":2,"order":2,"length":1.163,"offset":[0,0,-1]}],"extent":2.683},{"id":"so2","formula":"SO2","formulaDisplay":"SO₂","name":"Sulfur dioxide","nameZh":"二氧化硫","category":"inorganic","shape":"bent","shapeZh":"角形","summaryZh":"刺激性气味气体，是酸雨的主要成因之一。硫上有一对孤对电子，使分子呈角形。","summaryEn":"A pungent gas and a major cause of acid rain. A lone pair on sulfur bends the molecule instead of 